DRAFT LICENSE — PENDING LEGAL REVIEW, NOT YET FINAL
=====================================================

This file is a placeholder describing the intended licensing model for this
project. It is a product/technical description of intent, not legal text,
and must not be treated as a binding license until reviewed and finalized
by a lawyer.

Intended model: Business Source License 1.1 (BSL), source-available.

Summary of intent:
  - Anyone may view, self-host, modify, and use this software for internal
    purposes, free of charge, including commercial internal use.
  - The one restriction: no third party may offer this software (or a
    derivative of it) to others as a competing hosted/managed service
    without a separate commercial agreement with the licensor.
  - Change Date: 4 years from each version's release date.
  - Change License: on the Change Date, that version converts to
    Apache License, Version 2.0.

Until this file is replaced with finalized, lawyer-reviewed license text,
no license is granted and all rights are reserved.
